# Scenario reviewers are assigned sequentially by the trusted workflow. There
# is no global code owner because keting must never be auto-requested for the
# first scenario review.

# Protocol-level files: changing these changes the meaning of every existing
# scenario package, so they are called out explicitly.
/prompts/       @keting
/templates/     @keting
/scripts/       @keting
/.github/       @keting
/CONTRIBUTING.md        @keting
/CONTRIBUTING.zh-CN.md  @keting
/LICENSE        @keting
/LICENSE-DATA   @keting
/SECURITY.md    @keting
